<title>HONG KONG: Far East Bank sets US$100 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Far East Bank sets US$100 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Sakura Finance Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER FAR EAST BANK AND TRUST CO (PHILIPPINES)</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$100 MLN   COUPON    **	  MATURITY   *</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	 LAUNCHED   08.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     NONE	REPLIES    22.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING  --	     REPAYMENT BULLET    DENOMS 250K/500K/1MLN</p>
<p> RATINGS  --	     SALE LMTS STANDARD  TAX PROV   --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	 FORCE MAJ  YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY PHILIPPINES GOV LAW   ENGLISH   PAY DATE   07.NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTES    *SERIES 2 ( 1 YR)  US$30 MLN</p>
<p>	     SERIES 3 (4 YRS)  US$35 MLN</p>
<p>	     SERIES 4 (5 YRS)  US$35 MLN</p>
<p>	     (PRO-RATA BASIS COMMITMENT, AVERAGE LIFE = 3.45 YRS)</p>
<p>	   **SERIES 2 ( 1 YR)  3ML +60 BP</p>
<p>	     SERIES 3 (4 YRS)  3ML+ 85 BP</p>
<p>	     SERIES 4 (5 YRS)  3ML+ 90 BP</p>
<p>	  ***ISSUED OFF THE BORROWER'S US$200 MLN CD PROGRAMME</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>CO-LEAD MANAGER</p>
