<p>					 US$5-6 MLN		15.5 BP</p>
<p>	SERIES   ALLOCATION (PRO RATA)  UP FRONT   ALL-IN YIELD</p>
<p>	SERIES 2 (1 YR)	    30%	5 BP     ALL-IN  65 BP</p>
<p>	SERIES 3 (4 YRS)	   35%	20BP     ALL-IN  90 BP</p>
<p>	SERIES 4 (5 YRS)	   35%	20BP     ALL-IN  94 BP</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE ALL-IN YIELD APPROXIMATELY 89.86</p>
<p>BASIS POINTS FOR AN AVERAGE LIFE OF 3.45 YEARS</p>
<p>CO-MANAGER</p>
<p>	INITIAL COMMITMENT  (PRO RATA BASIS)    BLENDED UP-FRONT</p>
<p>					 US$3-4 MLN		12.05BP</p>
