<p>	SERIES 2 (1 YR)	    30%	4 BP     ALL-IN  64 BP</p>
<p>	SERIES 3 (4 YRS)	   35%	16BP     ALL-IN  89 BP</p>
<p>	SERIES 4 (5 YRS)	   35%	15BP     ALL-IN  93 BP</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE ALL-IN YIELD APPROXIMATELY 88.86</p>
<p>BASIS POINTS FOR AN AVERAGE LIFE OF 3.45 YEARS</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  CITICORP INTERNATIONAL, SAKURA FINANCE ASIA (BOOKS)</p>
